            'Branch `' + branchName + '` has ' + intro + ' that is not already merged into `origin/' + baseBranch + '`, ' +
            'and `origin/' + baseBranch + '` is not an ancestor of this branch.\n\n' +
            guidance + '\n\n' +
            (notes ? notes + '\n\n' : '') +
            'Details:\n\n```\n' + (details || '(not available)') + '\n```\n';
